QuestGuidance.Register("en",351,{
[11201]="70007880\n1\tDefeat marsh brood-watchers (total: 6)\030Defeat marsh-queen\030Defeat marsh-spiders (total: 4)\tThe brood-watcher presence lies between the old Marshwater Fort and the Woodsedge Ruins in the Midgewater Marshes. According to Edda Twiggins, a deadly new breed of spider has appeared in the northern Midgewater, and she has asked you to thin their numbers.\n2\tTalk to Edda Twiggins\tEdda Twiggins can be found to the south-east of the ruins in the northern Midgewater Marsh. Edda Twiggins will be pleased to hear of your success against the deadly marsh brood-watchers and their queen in the Midgewater Marshes.\n",
[11202]="700033B6\n1\tDefeat Greenfields Biters (total: 8)\030Defeat Greenfields Tree-weavers (total: 6)\030Defeat Greenfields Queen (total: 2)\tThe spiders can be found all throughout the quarry and the cave they swarmed from, cut into the cliff-face by Scary. Lily Proudfoot, worried that the spiders in the quarry might climb out of the rocky hole and take over her town, has asked you to kill off the creatures.\n2\tTalk to Lily Proudfoot\tLily Proudfoot is in Scary, looking out at the quarry. Lily Proudfoot was afraid that the spiders that the quarrymen unearthed would overrun Scary and asked you to help clear the threat. She will be pleased to learn of your success.\n",
[11203]="7006E4C8\n1\tDefeat Greenfields biters (total: 8)\030Defeat Greenfields tree-weavers (total: 6)\tThe spiders can be found all throughout the quarry and at the cave they swarmed from, cut into the cliff-face by Scary.\n2\tDefeat the Greenfields Queen\tYou have defeated most, if not all, of the spiders in the quarry, but the most important spider to dispose of yet remains. You should find and defeat the Greenfields Queen.\n",
[11204]="70030A99\n1\tDefeat Fangorn Web-hunters\tFangorn Web-hunters can be found in the furthest reaches of the Silkenhold. After defeating the spinners, the web-hunters ought to be your next prey.\n2\tDefeat Fangorn Web-hunters (total: 10)\tFangorn Web-hunters can be found in the furthest reaches of the Silkenhold. After defeating the spinners, the web-hunters ought to be your next prey.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a great many spiders in the Silkenhold of Fangorn, helping to stop the spread of evil in this land. Your good deeds will have lasting effects upon the Ents and other creatures of the forest.\n",
[11205]="70030A7E\n1\tDefeat Fangorn Spinners (total: 10)\tFangorn Spinners can be found in the Silkenhold of Fangorn, far in the north of the forest's eaves. You should defeat many Spinners in the Silkenhold, where spiders are clearly the greatest threat.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a horde of Fangorn Spinners, but there are many other evil beings to slay in the Silkenhold. Your work here is not yet done....\n",
[11206]="7000729F\n1\tDefeat spiders in Rath Teraig (total: 8)\tThere are spiders beyond the barricade south of the dwarf-camp. Tralli Hammerfist, deathly afraid of spiders, has asked you to defeat a few of the creatures for him.\n2\tTalk to Tralli Hammerfist\tTralli Hammerfist is at the dwarf-camp beyond the barricade at the northern entrance to Rath Teraig. You should return to Tralli Hammerfist with news of your success.\n",
[11207]="70054660\n1\tDefeat trap-door ambushers (total: 7)\tTrap-door ambushers can be found along the Winding Stair in Cirith Ungol. You should defeat trap-door ambushers.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[11208]="700571B3\n1\tDefeat Gundabad spies (total: 8)\tGundabad spies can be found in the Floodfells. You should defeat any Gundabad spies that you find.\n",
[11209]="70025C9C\n1\tTalk to Eliot Bencroft at Rantost\tRantost is north-west of Ost Forod. Basil sent you to meet with several spies he has among the tomb-robber camp on the isle of Rantost.\n",
[11210]="70035664\n1\tDefeat crebain and collect their beaks\tCrebain can be found all over the peaks of the western High Knolls. You should defeat crebain in the High Knolls.\n2\tKill spies of Saruman and collect their beaks (total: 10)\tCrebain can be found all over the peaks of the western High Knolls, especially near the Lonely Height in the north-west. You should defeat crebain in the High Knolls and collect their beaks to send back to Saruman.\n3\tThe crebain-roost is on the Lonely Height in the north-west High Knolls. You should find the biggest craban on the Lonely Height in the High Knolls, and send the beaks you collected with him to Saruman as a message of defiance.\t\n4\tCompleted\tYou have defied Saruman as best you could from this remote location. Hopefully he will be vexed by the affront.\n",
[11211]="70062E82\n1\tDefeat barrow-spirits in Tyrn Gorthad (total: 6)\030Defeat barrow-wights in Tyrn Gorthad (total: 6)\tFell spirits and wights threaten the peace of Tyrn Gorthad.\n2\tTalk to Ranger Faradan south-west of Calarphel in Tyrn Gorthad\tRanger Faradan is south-west of Calarphel in Tyrn Gorthad.\n",
[11212]="7005AB08\n1\tDefeat Angmarim in Bagud-dum (total: 10)\030Defeat fell spirits in Bagud-dum (total: 6)\tAngmarim of the Cult of Drugoth and the fell spirits they have summoned can be found in Bagud-dum. You should defeat Angmarim and fell spirits in Bagud-dum.\n2\tTalk to Hórin outside Bagud-dum\tHórin can be found outside the dwarf-fort Bagud-dum. You should talk to Hórin.\n",
[11213]="700191AA\n1\tCollect elanor-blossoms (total: 6)\030Collect niphredil-blossoms (total: 6)\tElanor and niphredil can be found upon and around Cerin Amroth. Tuilinn has asked you to pick more elanor and niphredil.\n2\tBring blossoms to Maliriel at the Hythe\030Bring blossoms to Ambendel at Echad Andestel\030Bring blossoms to Bahanneth at Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, west of Cerin Amroth. Ambendel is at Echad Andestel, south-west of Cerin Amroth. Maliriel is at the Hythe, east and south of Cerin Amroth, near the river. Tuilinn has asked you to bring elanor and niphredil-blossoms to Bahanneth, Ambendel, and Maliriel the Feast-mistress.\n3\tTalk to Tuilinn at Cerin Amroth\tTuilinn is atop the flet at Cerin Amroth. You should return to Tuilinn and relate to her how her gift lifted the spirits of her friends.\n",
[11214]="7002729A\n1\tDefeat Cuthraul at the Slade of Shadows (total: 10)\tCuthraul can be found in the Slade of Shadows, south of Andreg's position. Andreg has instructed you to defeat the Cuthraul in the Slade of Shadows.\n",
[11215]="700085D9\n1\tBring the tokens back to Gautar\030Collect tokens of Angmar from Imlad Balchorth (total: 8)\tThere are fell spirits in Imlad Balchorth, in the southern upper passes, south and west from Myrkworth. Gautar is in Myrkworth. Gautar has asked you to confront the fell spirits to learn if there might be a way to banish them from Middle-earth.\n",
[11216]="700544AE\n1\tDefeat shades in Minas Morgul (total: 10)\030Defeat fell spirits in Minas Morgul (total: 10)\tShades and fell spirits can be found in the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul. You should defeat any shades and fell spirits that you find.\n2\tTalk to Damrod in Barad Orhant\tDamrod can be found in Barad Orhant in Minas Morgul. You should talk to Damrod.\n",
[11217]="7003A5EA\n1\tSearch trees outside Underharrow (total: 6)\tTrees can be found to the west and south of Underharrow. Ellen Fremedon has asked you to investigate her peoples' claims that spirits have begun to haunt the nearby trees.\n2\tTalk to Ellen Fremedon\tEllen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow. You have searched the nearby trees and discovered Orcs adorned with skeletal markings and masks. You should return to Ellen Fremedon.\n",
[11218]="70052E8E\n1\tPut spirits to rest in Avabárg (total: 10)\tSpirits can be found in Avabárg. Atta has asked you to travel to Avabárg and put to rest the spirits of the unfortunate Woodmen that were taken by a terrible creature long ago.\n2\tTalk to Atta\tAtta can be found in Hultvís. You have defeated many of the spirits in Avabárg.\n",
[11219]="70048F80\n1\tDefeat Spitpyre\tSpitpyre can be found patrolling Mordor. You have encountered the threatening Spitpyre. Roaming the lava lake of Talath Úrui, the beast patrols its domain.\n2\tDefeat Spitpyre\tSpitpyre can be found patrolling Mordor. You have encountered the threatening Spitpyre. Roaming the lava lake of Talath Úrui, the beast patrols its domain.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Spitpyre.\n",
[11220]="7001570E\n1\tDefeat the Ghâsh-hai Captain\tThe Ghâsh-hai captain can be found in the centre of Ânghumu-ru. You should defeat the Ghâsh-hai Captain.\n2\tDefeat the Ghâsh-hai Captain of Ânghumu-ru\tThe Ghâsh-hai captain can be found in the centre of Ânghumu-ru. You should defeat the Ghâsh-hai Captain.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Ghâsh-hai Captain, causing confusion and disarray amongst the ranks of Orcs.\n",
[11221]="70041C72\n1\tRecover Gondorian relics from Barad Rill (total: 8)\030Plant a banner of Belfalas atop Barad Rill\tBarad Rill can be found far to the south-west of Linhir in Dor-en-Ernil. Herion has asked you to recover relics from Barad Rill as well as plant a banner of Belfalas atop its ruins.\n2\tDeliver the relics to Herion in Linhir\tHerion can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. You have recovered the relics and planted a banner atop the ruins of Barad Rill. You should now return to Herion.\n",
[11222]="7003A4B0\n1\tDefeat Rashat-hai\tYou have discovered a cave filled with vicious Orcs poised to strike against the Rohirrim. You should defeat many of their number.\n2\tDefeat Rashat-hai Warriors (total: 6)\030Defeat Rashat-hai Black-arrows (total: 4)\030Defeat Rashat-hai Defilers (total: 4)\tOrcs of the White Mountains can be found in Gurz-shâpol to the north of Dunharrow. You have discovered a cave filled with vicious Orcs poised to strike against the Rohirrim. You should defeat many of their number.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a great many Rashat-hai Orcs in Gurz-shâpol.\n",
[11223]="70054670\n1\tDestroy Ugrukhôr's supplies (total: 8)\tSupplies are running low in Ugrukhôr's encampment, west of Barad Angarth. You should seek out and destroy the supplies.\n2\tTalk to Dolenthol\tYou destroyed some of the supplies in Ugrukhôr's camp. You should return to Dolenthol and inform him of your victory.\n",
[11224]="70000D08\n1\tCollect Ivo Brockhouse's pie\tHolly Hornblower's home is north of the Hobbiton main square. Ivo Brockhouse has one of Holly's bad pies, which you should take back to her as quickly as possible. Make sure no hungry hobbits catch a whiff of the pie, as Holly doesn't want to be bothered with them asking for a slice, especially since she has to bake fresh pies for all her customers. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[11225]="70000D09\n1\tCollect Sapphira Bolger's pie\tHolly Hornblower's home is north of the Hobbiton main square. Sapphira Bolger has one of Holly's bad pies, which you should take back to her as quickly as possible. Make sure no hungry hobbits catch a whiff of the pie, as Holly doesn't want to be bothered with them asking for a slice, especially since she has to bake fresh pies for all her customers. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
